SY_TALK("O-AAMmqGOeU",[[1,["After the great tour of UK I feel very confident that Sahaja Yoga"]],[9,["is taking its roots, and you can see some of the plants coming up."]],[14,["It’s surprising, when I declared that it may be the last tour"]],[18,["I’ll be doing of UK that things have started working out."]],[23,["Everywhere we went it was very good and successful,"]],[28,["specially certain places it was very miraculous."]],[31,["You must have heard about the lady who would not go out of her house,"]],[36,["was suffering from agoraphobia,"]],[39,["and the press challenged us that she should be"]],[43,["cured because she can’t go out of the house."]],[45,["And only on her photograph and treatment she got cured, and now she’s walking about,"]],[51,["and they have given a big report saying that ‘The Guru fulfills Her promise’."]],[58,["This is one of them and there are many things have happened of this kind,"]],[62,["of which you should get the report."]],[65,["I must say I found all the sahaja yogis very cooperative,"]],[69,["very alert, very helpful and extremely progressive."]],[78,["And I was happy that they are trying to come up and improve themselves,"]],[83,["build themselves up, and are doing much better than what I had expected, really."]],[90,["I was very, very enamored by all of them, and I hope that by the time it"]],[95,["is 12 years, we’ll be all absolutely top class sahaja yogis of the world."]],[103,["Now today is a very great day of Raksha Bandhan,"]],[108,["so I have to tell you something about Raksha Bandhan."]],[113,["Before that we have to talk about the maryadas"]],[132,["that are to be observed by sahaja yogis."]],[140,["One of the things I discovered here, in the West,"]],[146,["that though we have understood the importance of Mooladhara, which is a very"]],[150,["important thing and that unless and until we re-establish our"]],[155,["Mooladhara fully we are not going to have a speediest ascent."]],[162,["Despite all that, still there are lingering things you see around."]],[168,["Like people start choosing their life partners in Sahaja Yoga."]],[179,["That is not allowed, that is not allowed."]],[184,["You are not to spoil your ashrams, your centres,"]],[190,["using them for a marriage searching society."]],[194,["You must respect it, this point you must respect."]],[198,["If you have to marry,"]],[201,["then you can find your life partner outside Sahaja Yoga – to begin with."]],[207,["But if you want to marry in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[211,["then you should not go on searching people in Sahaja Yoga."]],[216,["Is a very dangerous thing for Sahaja Yoga itself and for you people."]],[222,["That is one thing one should never try to do with sahaja yogis."]],[227,["For all practical purposes you are brothers and sisters."]],[231,["And that’s why I always encourage marriages between"]],[235,["people who belong to another country or another centres."]],[240,["As we are now having a marriage – big program"]],[247,["– I would say that most of the marriages which"]],[252,["were done like that are very successful than"]],[256,["the marriages that were selected and were done."]],[259,["It’s very wrong to do such a thing as to arrange"]],[262,["your marriage with a sahaja yogi by yourself."]],[266,["It will be dangerous."]],[267,["I don’t want to say anything, but it won’t turn out to be good,"]],[271,["because it is anti-God activity, absolutely anti-God."]],[275,["You are supposed to develop your brahmacharya,"]],[278,["you are supposed to develop your Mooladhara."]],[281,["Instead of that, if you start using a sahaja yogini or a sahaja yogi for"]],[286,["the selection of your married life, it’s going to be very, very troublesome."]],[290,["Your Mooladhara will not settle down."]],[293,["I mean that’s a very bad stroke for your development."]],[297,["Because of the background and the kind of conditioning you have had,"]],[302,["you people don’t"]],[303,["understand that it is important to maintain the purity of the centres,"]],[309,["and of every place. So any such relationship in one city is a very wrong thing."]],[316,["It spoils everyone."]],[317,["To add up to the trouble, it’s a habit of people, I have heard, that they try to"]],[323,["tease that “You look better together, you are nice together.” They tease and enjoy."]],[328,["It’s a kind of a very perverted enjoyment of Mooladhara, to tease others “You are"]],[336,["looking very nice with him,"]],[337,["and you better marry.” It’s a kind of a romantic nonsense."]],[341,["Of course, for all the yogis they have to have a brahmacharya."]],[345,["But even if you can’t have brahmacharya you must have maryadas."]],[351,["Not to tease each other and enjoy that kind of a nonsense,"]],[354,["when the marriage is not settled. [If] marriage [is] settled, is all right."]],[358,["And this kills completely the joy of marriage, because there is no curiosity left."]],[363,["And many a times I find that absurd relations are established."]],[367,["Some of them are really no good, and they will really be detrimental,"]],[371,["and some of them never are established."]],[374,["So if they are established, they are wrong,"]],[377,["and if they are not established, they are heartbreaking."]],[381,["So all this kind of thing you should not do."]],[384,["We’ve got experiences of people who married outside"]],[387,["and brought wonderful people to Sahaja Yoga."]],[390,["If you can do it, you should do it."]],[392,["But if you have to marry sahaja yogis, you should not marry them"]],[397,["at the cost of destroying the purity and the idealism it has."]],[402,["For your own sake, for your own pleasures,"]],[405,["you should not spoil the name of Sahaja Yoga."]],[407,["That is one thing I have seen, so I would say that today, as it is the day of purity"]],[413,["between relationship,"]],[414,["let us know that you have to treat each other as brothers and sisters."]],[421,["No such play should be followed."]],[423,["Don’t allow your mind to drift into this."]],[425,["Because if you allow, then there’s no end to it."]],[428,["As it is, you know how hard it is to bring you back to normalcy."]],[436,["When Christ had said, “Thou shalt not have adulterous"]],[439,["eyes,” He didn’t say it because it was not practical."]],[442,["It is quite practical for sahaja yogis."]],[445,["And there is nothing to worry about marriages so much."]],[448,["What is so important?"]],[449,["So many are married and what has happened to them."]],[451,["Even with Sahaja Yoga marriage,"]],[454,["some of them have failed because of these bad habits."]],[457,["So you better get rid of these bad habits before marriage,"]],[460,["because after marriage also they go on like this, and searching for boys and girls."]],[465,["Because if these habits are not curbed before marriage,"]],[468,["then they go on lingering on."]],[470,["So one should not try to do all these things before marriage."]],[474,["And I have seen such marriages are never, never successful so far."]],[479,["And even if they are, it is a sort of a make-believe thing."]],[482,["It doesn’t give real joy, it’s a joyless pursuit."]],[485,["Maybe in one case, may be successful;"]],[488,["that doesn’t mean that you should take any help from such difficult"]],[493,["things, but have normal marriages which are enjoyable,"]],[495,["which have created permanent bondages between people."]],[506,["Now we have to understand the maryadas, about which I have told you before also."]],[513,["The relationships between men and women are only"]],[517,["pure if a certain amount of boundaries are kept."]],[524,["Like, supposing you have milk in one container and"]],[530,["you have got something else in another container."]],[532,["To keep the purity of one container, you have to keep it in its bounds, in the cup."]],[538,["If you allow them to mix up, if they fall together and they mix up,"]],[543,["then there is no purity left – is a simple thing like that."]],[547,["One should understand, that we have to understand that how to keep our"]],[552,["relationships in proper respect to each other’s modesty and chastity."]],[561,["Now for example, there is a girl who is younger to you."]],[567,["You must keep all the distance from such a person."]],[571,["If she is much older than you, then it is all right."]],[576,["You can talk, laugh, joke – she’s much older than you."]],[580,["But normally with a girl who is younger to you, even much younger, you should try"]],[586,["to keep away, after all if she is a young girl; not with the children, but still."]],[592,["You must learn these things: how to maintain a distance."]],[596,["Now, if there’s a man who is younger to you,"]],[602,["then you must not have any funny ideas about such a person – is absolutely absurd."]],[608,["If some gentleman is younger to you, it’s in, only perversion you do such things."]],[614,["You see, you should not have any funny ideas about that person."]],[618,["It’s only done when there are emergencies, when there is no possibility of a"]],[622,["marriage,"]],[623,["when there are so many women or so many men – or under perverted conditions."]],[630,["We don’t have none of these conditions here, so we have to behave like normal"]],[634,["people, and when the proper atmosphere is given to us, why not make use of it?"]],[640,["Why should we create absurd things?"]],[642,["Then they come out to Me saying that “Mother, now we have decided to marry."]],[646,["Let us marry.” I have to say “Yes.” [With] many things I don’t want to say “Yes”,"]],[651,["but I have to say “Yes.” But [it] creates a very bad precedent."]],[655,["Maybe that in certain cases, as an exceptional case,"]],[657,["I might have chosen to marry somebody like that."]],[660,["But that doesn’t mean you should take things into your hands,"]],[663,["and just start doing things like that, so that I’ll have problems later on."]],[668,["Because once you do like that, then anybody starts doing."]],[671,["It’s a kind of an aggressiveness, that you arrange something, come to Me, say."]],[675,["“Mother, we want to marry.” Now what am I to say?"]],[678,["“All right, marry.” But it creates a problem for Me, for the rest of the people."]],[681,["They will say, “All right."]],[683,["If he has married a girl who is twenty years younger,"]],[685,["why not I marry a girl who is thirty years younger?”"]],[688,["You must understand My problems."]],[690,["If you ask Me for something, “Mother,"]],[692,["should I do it?” You really force Me into it – I have to say “Yes” ."]],[695,["I cannot be very strict with you, because I am your Mother."]],[699,["But you should be sensible what to ask Me, how far to go."]],[702,["This is the biggest maryada you have to learn."]],[704,["Suddenly you will come, “Mother, should I sit here?” What do I say?"]],[708,["Should I make this gentleman sit here?"]],[710,["What should I say? “All right”."]],[712,["You yourself should not ask such a question."]],[715,["Because sometimes you give undue importance to somebody, who is “my brother,”"]],[720,["who is “my sister” – something – and make that person sit on My head."]],[723,["Sometimes you telephone to Me, “Mother, she would like to talk to You.” Who is she?"]],[728,["Is she all right? Should we take her to Mother?"]],[732,["Is she capable of talking to Mother?"]],[734,["What is her condition?"]],[736,["Will she trouble Mother?"]],[737,["Nobody thinks about it!"]],[739,["So you must first establish your relationship with Me of"]],[743,["proper understanding that you should not try to trouble Me."]],[747,["But this is something is not yet in My hands."]],[752,["I think because people do not understand what they are doing."]],[756,["So first try to see that you don’t try to take advantage of Me."]],[761,["And secondly, don’t try to bring people to Me who do not deserve it."]],[766,["There is no need to waste My time with them."]],[768,["I have so much things to be done, so many ideas to be formulated."]],[774,["I have to work so hard."]],[776,["You know, I am working harder than any one of you, those who are doing Sahaja Yoga."]],[780,["And at this age, if you try to trouble Me like that, I don’t know how"]],[784,["to tell you that “Don’t you trouble Me!” In the presence of the person"]],[787,["you will come, you will bring the person on My head, “Oh,"]],[790,["that person has come from Timbuktu, and I have brought her.” Just you do it."]],[794,["It’s aggressiveness on Me."]],[796,["Please don’t try to do like this!"]],[798,["This is a wrong thing to do."]],[800,["So the maryadas are to be established first with Me,"]],[803,["that understand that you should not try to trouble Me at all like this."]],[807,["Secondly, you must try to please Me by being good people."]],[813,["I hear that somebody is trying to be very egoistical."]],[816,["He doesn’t even put on My tapes, he just gives his own lectures."]],[820,["This kind of a thing is very surprising."]],[823,["How can people do like that?"]],[824,["Try to bring down your egos, super egos."]],[827,["You must learn to please Me, “Prasanno bhave Devi, prasanno bhave”."]],[832,["If you cannot make the Devi Prasanna (pleased), what will be your achievement?"]],[838,["As Rustom says that I am Mahamaya."]],[840,["All right, but don’t you know that I am that?"]],[843,["So try to keep to it."]],[844,["And keep that understanding that if you have to grow,"]],[848,["we must have proper relationship with"]],[851,["Mother, and we must understand what will displease Her the most."]],[854,["“Am I pleasing Her by"]],[855,["doing this?” But if you force Me, “If it pleases You,"]],[859,["we’ll do.” Then what am I to say? “All"]],[861,["right, go ahead.” If it pleases Me I’ll just spontaneously say,"]],[864,["“All right, it pleases Me. Go ahead with it!” Like that,"]],[867,["so many things are there that people just try to force on Me and I say “Yes”."]],[871,["But I am very cunning and clever in that,"]],[874,["because I tell in a way that you should realise that it is not joy giving."]],[879,["All right, whatever it is."]],[881,["Now the second thing is that the maryadas of relationships"]],[885,["between you is a relationship of pure love, of purity."]],[890,["Unless and until you develop pure relationships, you are going to be ruined!"]],[895,["See, this finger has to have pure relationship with this hand."]],[899,["Supposing if this finger has some dirty feelings about this hand,"]],[903,["it may dirty it, it may spoil it."]],[905,["In the same way, we should have extremely pure relationships with each other. Means,"]],[911,["we should try to give our heart to another person without any lust or greed in it."]],[917,["That we should try to do."]],[919,["Try to help each other."]],[920,["I find when they feel in a lusty way,"]],[923,["or a greedy way attached to others – this is not"]],[926,["for the sahaja yogis,"]],[927,["but non sahaja yogis – they get so much interested in that person."]],[930,["Is a very baser way of attachment."]],[933,["But in Sahaja Yoga, your attachment is with your Spirit,"]],[937,["with your Atma, and Atma is the purest form of our being."]],[941,["We have to keep it absolutely pure."]],[943,["And then the enjoyment is higher than any romance, any marriage, any worldly thing."]],[948,["It’s the highest and the top-most. First achieve that."]],[952,["First of all you should arise and achieve that, achieve that purity."]],[956,["That is very important."]],[958,["Now the relationship between the men and women, I have told you, that you should"]],[963,["not try to enter into any bedrooms where the ladies are – it’s not proper."]],[969,["Nor the women should enter into men’s thing. But is very common."]],[974,["Women should not behave in the way other women behave."]],[977,["Like, I was told in a wedding in Maharashtra that"]],[981,["the women went and took out all their clothes."]],[983,["I mean, that’s not England."]],[985,["They got a shock, you know."]],[986,["Some of them lost their appetite for three, four days."]],[988,["They have never seen such women in their lifetime."]],[991,["They went and took out their clothes suddenly, all of them."]],[994,["I mean, they were shocked, so much shocked that three,"]],[996,["four days they didn’t eat their food."]],[998,["So you have no business to shock them also."]],[1001,["Because if you go to somebody’s country, you must know in what way they live."]],[1005,["It’s never done. Nobody becomes nude like that."]],[1008,["And about twenty girls, if suddenly they become nude, what will happen?"]],[1012,["So the sense of shame must be developed among men and women."]],[1016,["It looks nice, it looks beautiful."]],[1019,["It gives you an additional charm if you have the sense of shame,"]],[1023,["a little bashfulness."]],[1024,["See, your Princess of Wales is regarded as something beautiful. She is bashful."]],[1029,["Her bashfulness is so natural."]],[1031,["That bashfulness is not there, like a – I don’t know what animal does that,"]],[1037,["but somebody who has no shame."]],[1040,["I mean, I just don’t know which one is that."]],[1042,["Everybody has a sense of shame, even animals."]],[1044,["So why shouldn’t we have that sense of shame?"]],[1047,["How to behave towards women, how to be… Suddenly there is"]],[1053,["no need to just… I have seen one lady going from England to"]],[1060,["India, and she just went and put a big slap on the back of Mr."]],[1065,["Modi, “Hello Modi, how are you?” And Modi got such a shock."]],[1071,["She didn’t mean, she was innocent,"]],[1074,["but that’s not the way in Sahaja Yoga we are going to behave, like some"]],[1078,["sort of a debonair or some sort of a fantastic,"]],[1082,["what you call, a modern woman, you see, walking in like that."]],[1087,["One must understand one must have a sense of shame."]],[1089,["How do you talk, even with Me they will talk with a hand like that “Mother,"]],[1094,["(?) thing is happening.” But there’s no need to do all that, you see."]],[1098,["Talk in a way that is gentle and beautiful."]],[1101,["The other day I met a very nice taxi fellow."]],[1104,["And I tell you, his gestures and things were so beautiful."]],[1107,["Immediately I said, “He is a realised soul.” He would not say anything"]],[1110,["without putting his hand like this, and with his eyes down below."]],[1113,["He would not say something like that, nothing of the kind."]],[1116,["So sweet he was, his whole gesture. He is an Englishman."]],[1120,["Brought up and bred here."]],[1122,["Not a single vulgar word he said."]],[1125,["Like one of your players was so stupid,"]],[1127,["when Princess Anne went to meet him he said all kinds of things, you see."]],[1131,["Is a kind of an ego, or stupidity, I don’t know, because,"]],[1134,["how you talk, how you speak, everything should be saintly."]],[1138,["You are saints now, do you realise? You are all saints."]],[1143,["So how you behave with dignity towards each other,"]],[1145,["how you respect their dignity, how you live, is very important,"]],[1149,["and that you should try to maintain in a way that looks like a saintly behavior."]],[1156,["You have to be a saint."]],[1157,["And that is not difficult for you, to take to that,"]],[1160,["that you behave in a manner that you are saints."]],[1162,["This is very important I must tell you because I have seen that these maryadas."]],[1167,["It would be killing, it would be absolutely killing Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1173,["if you do not keep your maryadas."]],[1176,["That is one of the most essential things one has to be."]],[1180,["I have told you again and again how you dress up,"]],[1185,["how you bear yourself up, how you talk, how you listen to others more"]],[1190,["than you talk yourself, how you become non-aggressive,"]],[1194,["is the best way to impress people and to express Sahaja Yoga."]],[1198,["I tell you, as it is, people have started saying,"]],[1201,["“They are very beautiful people, you can see they are very beautiful."]],[1204,["You can see they are very different type."]],[1206,["It’s something different."]],[1208,["They are something great.” People have started saying that."]],[1212,["But still we lack in certain things, like we start going on a plane which"]],[1217,["is not suitable to our stature, to our dignity, to our position as saints."]],[1225,["We are all prophets, and prophets have to behave like prophets."]],[1229,["They cannot behave like cheap type people."]],[1231,["So, in that we have to understand the maryadas."]],[1234,["Now the maryaada to your leaders also, you should be respectful."]],[1239,["I have seen that nobody calls anybody – even the children will call somebody,"]],[1245,["say, elderly person also – never they, say, call them uncle or anything."]],[1250,["It’s a wrong thing. You must teach your children to call elders"]],[1253,["by the name as brother or uncle or someone."]],[1256,["Give some respect to the elders."]],[1259,["But when the leader is also not respected, what is the question of it?"]],[1263,["I have seen little boys calling big,"]],[1267,["married people with three, four children, by name."]],[1270,["That’s not our style. You should never do it."]],[1272,["I saw this – even My husband’s office has this problem."]],[1276,["Because when I came, you see, they always called you by name."]],[1279,["“Tom”- he’s such a big man, he’s called as “Tom”, and all that."]],[1282,["So C.P. looked at it like that you see."]],[1285,["And we always call them – even the drivers, we call them by the name “Mr.,” you see."]],[1290,["So we couldn’t understand why is it like this."]],[1293,["You see, being democratic or something like this,"]],[1296,["you see, that’s how you become demonocratic. We must respect."]],[1300,["We must respect each other, must call them by higher names."]],[1304,["Specially when in a meeting, there are people, you should call them – each other,"]],[1309,["even your friends – by “Mr. so and so.” It’s all right for Me to call you."]],[1314,["It would look very funny if I call “Mr. Brown” or “Mr."]],[1318,["Reeves” because they are My children, you see, I’m their Mother."]],[1321,["But for you, because you are equal, this thing,"]],[1324,["at least call them “Mr.” and say something in a way which is good."]],[1328,["Like the English language has many words as “please”,"]],[1331,["“thank you.” All these must be used profusely, profusely."]],[1335,["We are going back a little bit."]],[1337,["We are now becoming much more modern."]],[1339,["That we should give up and become less modern and more elevating."]],[1344,["Now the whole idea of this maryada is such that"]],[1354,["when you have called somebody as a sister or a"]],[1356,["brother then it is not only lip service – “You are"]],[1360,["my sister” – it is something innate, and very deep."]],[1365,["You have to develop that feeling of a sister, because that’s how your sublimity"]],[1370,["will go up, your left Vishuddhi will improve, your Vishnumaya will be satisfied."]],[1375,["If you call somebody a sister,"]],[1377,["the sisterly and the daughterly relationships, and motherly"]],[1381,["relationships, always bring down, you see,"]],[1384,["the so-called ego, which is hiding in the left Vishuddhi."]],[1389,["So try to be kind and gentle with the person whom you call the sister."]],[1394,["Stand by her, look after her."]],[1395,["If somebody you call your brother, you have to pray for his protection,"]],[1401,["then you must know that you have a right to ask him for his protection also."]],[1407,["But you must also give something to him, and you must try to look after him,"]],[1412,["welcome him to your house, and treat him as a"]],[1416,["somebody, a part and parcel of your being, because he’s very much"]],[1420,["near to you because he is your brother, and he’s very much closer."]],[1423,["But such a brother should not try to dominate the wife."]],[1426,["This is the maryada, again."]],[1429,["Like a brother is, somehow, is very friendly with the brother, or a lady is friendly"]],[1433,["as a sister, then she should not try to put a wedge between the husband and wife."]],[1438,["That is the worst thing to do, is to put a wedge between husband and wife."]],[1442,["Anybody who tries that must know that he’s a mean person."]],[1445,["One should never try to put a wedge between husband and wife."]],[1448,["I know there are problems between husband and wife, I’ll put them right."]],[1452,["But you don’t try to put any wedge between them."]],[1454,["And don’t try to create a problem."]],[1456,["If it is problematic, it is for Me to solve, not you people don’t have to solve."]],[1461,["And don’t interfere with their married life."]],[1463,["Let them be as they are."]],[1465,["I will find out how they are, I’ll try to help them."]],[1468,["But it’s very wrong to play with their married life or with their married problems,"]],[1473,["and suddenly jump on somebody."]],[1475,["Is a very wrong thing, which is very common here."]],[1477,["And [if] a woman is in distress, you see, a man will come to help her,"]],[1481,["even if she is married, he’ll elope with her."]],[1484,["This is how he comes to help her in the distress,"]],[1487,["to create another distress for her!"]],[1490,["So this is how one should understand that this kind of a cheap"]],[1494,["heart giving business, and taking business, is not for Sahaja Yoga."]],[1500,["In our heart resides the Spirit."]],[1503,["We are dignified people,"]],[1505,["and in that dignity we have to rise and live with that dignity."]],[1511,["Not to cheaply allow the Spirit to be insulted or dominated or subjugated to anyone."]],[1517,["Now the relationship with children also one should understand."]],[1521,["I have seen some people have a habit of getting a child very much closer,"]],[1526,["and pampering them, “Oh, that child is this thing."]],[1530,["Oh, that child…” Let the parents handle the child,"]],[1533,["you just don’t interfere with other’s children."]],[1536,["Don’t interfere much with them."]],[1538,["If you find any child is such and such, inform Me, I’ll cure the child."]],[1543,["But if a child is being spoilt by you,"]],[1545,["it’s the worst thing to do is to harm that child, is to spoil."]],[1550,["Children here are very clever and intelligent, you must know."]],[1554,["They are very good at manipulating."]],[1556,["They will, because they are extremely precocious."]],[1559,["They are realised souls, they are born in this country. What a combination!"]],[1564,["At that time you must be very careful as to their training."]],[1567,["From the first five years all the parents must be extremely strict with children,"]],[1573,["extremely strict. Don’t allow them to overpower you or manoeuvre, manipulate you."]],[1580,["It’s very important."]],[1582,["If you allow them to overpower you or to dominate you, they’ll sit on your head."]],[1586,["Tell them not to do like that."]],[1588,["And one day you will come and say, “Mother, what to do, these are realised"]],[1592,["souls and, you see, we were looking after them.” They are not deities!"]],[1597,["They are not deities to be worshipped!"]],[1599,["They are only realised souls."]],[1601,["So keep them at that point."]],[1602,["And you are My trustees of those children."]],[1606,["And if you spoil them, it is you who will he held responsible."]],[1609,["You have no business to spoil the lives of these children as sahaja yogis,"]],[1613,["and their chances of ascent."]],[1615,["So if they are born-realised, they are not deities – this you must understand."]],[1619,["They are not beyond corruption, they are not beyond all kinds of things."]],[1624,["So this, if you understand this little point,"]],[1627,["that dealing with your children you have to be really strict."]],[1630,["They must know how to meditate, they must know how to pray,"]],[1634,["they must know how to respect; and all the good things you must teach your children."]],[1638,["And don’t allow them to sit on your head."]],[1640,["Many people have ruined the lives of their children like this."]],[1644,["Now will you please see that such child is brought into proper level?"]],[1648,["If the child is trying to take liberties with you,"]],[1652,["and cheeky and does not listen, please give that child to"]],[1655,["some other sahaja yogi to look after,"]],[1657,["whom you think can look after, and see that the child is put right."]],[1661,["Nip in the bud is the best way,"]],[1663,["because we don’t want to have children who are spoilt,"]],[1666,["who are spoiling other children,"]],[1669,["nor we want children who are subjected to such children."]],[1674,["So, you can have proper children, well-behaved children, sensible, wise children."]],[1680,["Because they can really be a drag on you, on Me,"]],[1684,["on everyone, if you do not properly bring them up."]],[1687,["And they are our liabilities; we have to look after them."]],[1691,["So the relationship between the father and children,"]],[1694,["mother and children, is important."]],[1697,["Actually the mother should look after the child much more."]],[1700,["And the child must respect."]],[1701,["Father should never scold the mother in the presence of the child."]],[1704,["That’s one thing one must understand, that, if the father starts scolding the"]],[1708,["mother in the presence of the child, the child will have no respect for the mother."]],[1711,["But the respect must be maintained, because if the wife respects the husband,"]],[1715,["then the child will know how to respect her and the husband too."]],[1720,["So the whole thing is built up like that."]],[1723,["Is a kind of a pattern for children to follow."]],[1726,["One should not try to dominate the husband, at least in the presence of children."]],[1732,["It is very wrong,"]],[1733,["because then the children learn that trick and they start dominating you."]],[1737,["So it flows from you to children."]],[1739,["So try to see that if you have to do anything then you do it yourself."]],[1744,["And respect the husband and in a way that is very obvious"]],[1748,["to the child that the father is respected by mother."]],[1751,["And they are just like monkeys."]],[1753,["The way you behave, they behave."]],[1755,["So you allow them to behave in a particular manner, they will behave that way."]],[1760,["But if you put a good pattern…"]],[1762,["The other day I was thinking, how Indian children are so obedient, so sensible."]],[1767,["They will never ask for it. “I want this, I want that.” They never manipulate."]],[1773,["What happens? What happens, how do they do it?"]],[1777,["The reason is, I think, is a good pattern in the house."]],[1780,["Everybody knows whom to respect, how to respect, how to behave."]],[1784,["The relationship in Sahaja Yoga has to be even more than this, much more subtler."]],[1790,["For example, if – this I’ve said before also – if we are in a room,"]],[1796,["try to give another person a room always, try to. Try to do for them."]],[1800,["If you have to pay, better pay yourself, not that wait for another person to pay."]],[1806,["Try to do it yourself, run forward to do it."]],[1809,["You see, if someone is carrying the luggage, you run, you do it."]],[1813,["That is the way a sahaja yogi should be."]],[1815,["Mostly, children are like that."]],[1816,["They’ll say, “I’ll get it, I’ll do it,"]],[1817,["I’ll receive it.” May be ego, you might call it, but whatever it is,"]],[1821,["but that is the style you all have to achieve by organising"]],[1827,["a proper type of an image for the whole society."]],[1832,["That if somebody needs something, you run away. “You want water?"]],[1835,["All right… You want this thing?"]],[1836,["You take mine.” Food also – same thing."]],[1838,["First let others have, not that you should first have anything."]],[1842,["How you eat your food is very important,"]],[1844,["everything is very important for the children to see, and to behave like that."]],[1850,["In money matters also, I have seen that people should be very,"]],[1855,["very sensible and should have proper maryadas."]],[1859,["Now with Me, whatever maryadas you want to keep, you must understand,"]],[1864,["because [it’s] very embarrassing to talk about it."]],[1866,["But so far, as you know that,"]],[1868,["I had to shell out lot of money to manage many funds, many things."]],[1873,["And last time also we had many people who came (?) doesn’t matter."]],[1877,["But now as it is…would you not do just now!"]],[1883,["In My lecture why should you do?"]],[1886,["At the time, now, when we are talking about maryadas, we must know that,"]],[1891,["in any case, Mother should not be made to pay anymore."]],[1896,["Because we are so many, we should try to manage, if possible."]],[1899,["Like yesterday, I had a person from BBC, and he said,"]],[1903,["“It is wrong of You not to take any money from them.” I said, “Where is the money?"]],[1907,["No question of taking, I have to pay Myself.” I said,"]],[1912,["“It is so invaluable that how can you charge for it?"]],[1915,["You cannot charge for it, it is very invaluable."]],[1917,["The Spirit is very invaluable, and you cannot charge for it.” So he was insisting."]],[1922,["I mean, he took half an hour on this subject only."]],[1925,["He said, “This Anglo-Saxon brain won’t understand unless and until You"]],[1930,["make it a little more money-oriented or something.” I said, “I cannot."]],[1936,["Tell me how much is to be paid.” Just to shut him down, I said, “What about Christ?"]],[1940,["How much money did He take?"]],[1941,["By God’s grace I am quite well off and I really don’t need either."]],[1946,["But He needed, still He never took any money from anyone.” Then he kept quiet."]],[1951,["But this is what it is, you see, that people think that you are getting it easy,"]],[1957,["cheap and that’s why you want to take advantage, which is wrong."]],[1964,["You must respect."]],[1966,["You must respect and understand that it is never good to take any advantage of Me."]],[1974,["On the contrary, whenever it is possible we should try to do"]],[1978,["whatever is possible for Sahaja Yoga – is very important. Try to surrender."]],[1983,["Not that I will take any money from you, you know that."]],[1986,["I don’t want any money or anything."]],[1988,["But surrender yourself absolutely to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1991,["That’s the best way people have risen and have done so well."]],[1995,["Now the relationship among yourselves,"]],[2001,["among different groups, among different nations."]],[2007,["We should try to help people who, supposing there is a couple now,"]],[2013,["wants to go to India to get married."]],[2015,["Now if they don’t have money, of course I am there."]],[2018,["I said, “All right, they need not pay any money,"]],[2020,["I’ll pay for them.” But Warren has put down his foot, he says, “Why"]],[2026,["not the people, or the centre, help them out,"]],[2030,["for the time being?” You see because they helped; now supposing they"]],[2033,["have helped somebody – he had no money, he went to India,"]],[2036,["he got married and then he got lost, you see, he misbehaved,"]],[2040,["in the sense, he doesn’t talk to anyone, he thinks no end of himself,"]],[2043,["then he started behaving in a funny manner."]],[2046,["So a kind of a feeling came into their mind that “Why should we do it?"]],[2050,["If you do it for somebody, he behaves like this."]],[2053,["If you try to help somebody…” Is this a natural reaction that if"]],[2057,["you try to do something for someone then people try to misbehave? That’s not so."]],[2062,["Must be one person has done it, that doesn’t mean that everybody has done it."]],[2066,["That’s what it is."]],[2067,["They say that a kind of a barrier is built in a person who is helped by us, and his"]],[2073,["ego is challenged, and he tries to behave in a manner which was never known before."]],[2078,["And he starts behaving in such a funny manner that he doesn’t talk to anyone,"]],[2082,["he keeps out and he becomes mad with his ego. So his ego is hurt."]],[2087,["There’s nothing to feel hurt."]],[2089,["Because if you have no money and if it is one part and one body,"]],[2092,["if somebody’s helping you out, doesn’t matter."]],[2094,["You can help, when you are well off, to somebody else."]],[2096,["But when it comes to you, you give up."]],[2098,["So this is a very absurd type of a behavior of one individual,"]],[2103,["or two or three, or maybe five or ten. Doesn’t matter."]],[2105,["But still we must not forget that we have to help."]],[2109,["We have to help as many as possible."]],[2111,["And we must try to do whatever is possible for us, for others. This is important."]],[2115,["If we cannot do for a group, like sahaja yogis, whom are we going to help?"]],[2119,["So we have to give that help."]],[2121,["Now in Sahaja Yoga itself,"]],[2123,["on the subtle basis we should not try to judge anybody’s vibrations."]],[2127,["It is very common in people, “Oh, you are caught up on your Agnya."]],[2130,["Oh, you have got this wrong, let me clear you out."]],[2132,["You sit down.” Morning till evening, without meditating,"]],[2135,["they are clearing each other’s chakras and catching on themselves."]],[2138,["It’s an absolutely wrong idea."]],[2140,["Everybody, individually, should sit before the photograph,"]],[2143,["get the vibrations, every morning, there should be a discipline."]],[2146,["You must know that the system of Sahaja Yoga today has worked out this way that"]],[2150,["I have given you Realisation just to say that – let your light be enlightened."]],[2154,["Now you have to see your lamp, if it is clean or not."]],[2158,["Only possible when the light is enlightened."]],[2160,["See your lamp, if it is enlightened or not."]],[2162,["See, if somebody is over-aggressive, then it’s all right,"]],[2166,["you make a joint attack on that person, and tell-off that person."]],[2169,["Or there are leaders who will do it."]],[2170,["But everybody should not judge others."]],[2173,["You better judge yourself, cleanse yourself, look after yourself,"]],[2176,["and also try to see how your lamp is – is it clean?"]],[2180,["Mother has given us the light to see and why not see?"]],[2183,["So if you work it out on these lines, you’ll go very fast."]],[2187,["And you have to, now, perfect yourself."]],[2190,["We have so many sahaja yogis."]],[2192,["But how many are perfect?"]],[2194,["This is the point is."]],[2195,["Now your relationship to Sahaja Yoga is also very important."]],[2198,["There’s a maryada about it very much."]],[2200,["Sahaja Yoga should not be taken for granted."]],[2202,["Anybody who thinks he has got Realisation and now"]],[2205,["he is sitting on top of the world – is not so."]],[2207,["You must work it out, you have to have discipline."]],[2211,["The same gentleman, the BBC fellow, was saying that it was before,"]],[2215,["for years together, you had to live in celibacy and wash the feet of"]],[2221,["the …wash the steps of the temple and do all kinds of things, work hard,"]],[2226,["do this, do that – and then they would raise it to one chakra. I said,"]],[2231,["“Now we do it the other way round!” First build the dome and then the foundation."]],[2238,["Sahaja Yoga is like that."]],[2240,["So that with the dome you understand, you are protected, you are looked after."]],[2243,["But people take it for granted, like. “Mother will do it."]],[2247,["Leave it to Mother.” No, it is not so. You are My hands."]],[2251,["Supposing My hands have to lift this, I should say that Nirmala will do it?"]],[2254,["Now, which is Nirmala? These hands are the Nirmala at this point."]],[2258,["So, many people drift like that."]],[2261,["So, to Sahaja Yoga also, your attitude should be of respect."]],[2266,["You should not try to put yourself into bandhan before others, you should not"]],[2271,["try to do these things, but in a dignified way you must respect Sahaja Yoga."]],[2275,["And foremost of all, to Sahaja Yoga your relationship"]],[2278,["should be that you should know Sahaja Yoga, what it is."]],[2281,["Otherwise every time if you have to talk about Sahaja, Gavin must come, or somebody."]],[2286,["Why? Gavin didn’t know a word about Sahaja Yoga, he didn’t know a word about Indian"]],[2290,["mythology, he didn’t know anything,"]],[2292,["he did not know what Realisation is – he studied. He’s even studying Sanskrit."]],[2296,["Like many of you have done it."]],[2298,["But all of you, one and all, should become a big pandit."]],[2302,["But you get lost in your marriage problems."]],[2305,["Then your children’s problems."]],[2307,["Then “my mother,” then “my sister.” I mean, it will take too much time for you."]],[2311,["First of all you should see, “I am a sahaja yogi."]],[2314,["Let me get to work.” And it creates problems for us also."]],[2317,["Because your wife will sue you, your children will come round, this, that."]],[2320,["You should say, “I have nothing to do, I am going to study Sahaja Yoga.” I was"]],[2324,["surprised that many people have taken The Advent just like as a Bible,"]],[2330,["They never read it."]],[2332,["I was surprised that some people do not know what I have written in the Bible."]],[2337,["So it is like the Jews, you see, having a Golden Bible tied up here."]],[2342,["They keep The Advent in a very good cover near the photograph,"]],[2347,["worship it – finished."]],[2350,["Then the knowledge goes into them straight away!"]],[2354,["You must read some chapters at least of Advent, if not anything else."]],[2358,["There are so many books you can read [that] I have told you."]],[2361,["Try to make your own library."]],[2363,["Try to improve in it."]],[2364,["Everybody must try to get perfection it – perfectionism."]],[2367,["You should never be a liability on Sahaja Yoga, but a great asset of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2371,["That’s what everybody should try to be."]],[2374,["That, your problems I will solve."]],[2376,["But you solve your ascent."]],[2378,["they go into an ashram, and then they think this is their house."]],[2383,["They live there, they manipulate all the money that they save and this and that,"]],[2388,["and develop this, want to make everything comfortable."]],[2391,["They never think that, “This is not my ashram."]],[2394,["I am doing it because I am a sahaja yogi."]],[2397,["This is the Ashram of Mother."]],[2399,["I have to do it.” But that detachment is not there."]],[2403,["Not at all a detachment."]],[2405,["And it is something surprising, that if you have to go to Himalayas and"]],[2410,["make an insurance policy, then what’s the use of coming to Sahaja Yoga?"]],[2417,["It is as absurd as that, that we are writing to insurance policies,"]],[2422,["that “I have gone to Himalayas."]],[2424,["When I die, give my property to this one."]],[2426,["If I don’t die, I’ll come back after that.” And nicely"]],[2431,["packing up in a nice plastic bag so that ice doesn’t spoil it."]],[2437,["It’s as absurd as that!"]],[2440,["So you should not have anything."]],[2442,["Now some people have a habit, “Oh, I’ll get a house for myself."]],[2445,["Get my wife there, children there, finished!.” All such people should, for a change,"]],[2450,["leave their houses, come to ashram, put some other people in their house."]],[2455,["Because they are getting attached, you see."]],[2457,["How will you get detached?"]],[2459,["Is there any way out?"]],[2460,["That is very important in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2463,["Unless and until you are detached, you cannot ascend."]],[2465,["Supposing you have all the tentacles down here on the Mother Earth,"]],[2469,["and you say, “Let this plane fly,” how will it go?"]],[2472,["So those people who have houses of their own,"]],[2475,["or buildings of their own or anything – flats – should give up their houses."]],[2479,["Not to be that comfortable. Get out of it."]],[2481,["Ask some other people to shift, and you shift to the ashram."]],[2484,["Go on shifting, training your mind to shift,"]],[2488,["to live with everyone, to be able to share and to do things."]],[2492,["I have changed forty houses after My marriage, you can imagine."]],[2498,["What a very multi-purpose house."]],[2500,["And I have changed, so far, forty houses, and if I change now this house,"]],[2505,["Hester’s (Hester Spiro) house, it will be the forty-first."]],[2508,["You can imagine, I have been married forty years and forty houses I have changed."]],[2513,["So the relationship of purity must be understood, in everything."]],[2517,["Is it pure relationship?"]],[2519,["Am I living in this ashram in pure relationship? “Because this is the house"]],[2524,["that is giving me comfort, that’s why I am living in this house, or am I"]],[2527,["just living here, just because it’s an abode – I am here today, and I will"]],[2531,["be there tomorrow?” You will be amazed, you will enjoy every part of life."]],[2536,["As soon as you are attached, you are doomed!"]],[2539,["It’s a headache to be attached to something."]],[2542,["Then you hanker. “My wife has not arrived."]],[2545,["Oh God, what to do now?"]],[2547,["I must telephone to her,"]],[2548,["get her here.” But if you are detached about it – she’ll come in time."]],[2552,["Not only that, but you will enjoy her company."]],[2555,["Otherwise you’ll shout at her, “Why didn’t you come in time?"]],[2559,["I was waiting for you.” Then why were you waiting to scold her,"]],[2562,["and shout at her and spoil all the relationship?"]],[2564,["Just see, the absurdity of the whole thing is the attachment."]],[2568,["You should get completely detached about everything, and you will enjoy, just enjoy."]],[2574,["But in that also,"]],[2576,["one has to judge – you are really enjoying or you are just making a drama out of it?"]],[2582,["Try to be sincere. Purity is brought forth by sincerity."]],[2585,["If you are not sincere to yourself and to others, you cannot be pure."]],[2590,["And purity is the main thing you have to achieve in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2594,["apart from the unity, which I have given you."]],[2597,["But if you do not use this unity for purity – no use."]],[2602,["So this light should give you complete wisdom that you enjoy a pure, good life."]],[2609,["You are married, all right, you have life of enjoyment with your wife;"]],[2614,["that I have already described to you."]],[2618,["And with your wife how to behave also,"]],[2621,["I have described to you many a times, or with your husband."]],[2625,["But when it comes to others,"]],[2628,["you should have absolutely pure relationship of no exploitation."]],[2634,["Even there are flirting exploitations, as the same as money exploitations."]],[2640,["Here if you exploit somebody by money it’s called a thug,"]],[2643,["but flirting is not called anything."]],[2645,["I think that is a much worse crime, according to Christ."]],[2648,["So you have to be careful on this point,"]],[2651,["and understand that relationship with each other has to be clear."]],[2656,["Now there are people who have, say, horrible wives or horrible husbands."]],[2662,["I don’t mind, they can give them up."]],[2664,["If they are absolutely impossible, if they are spoiling their purity,"]],[2668,["if they are torturing their lives, then is best is to get rid of them, I don’t mind."]],[2674,["Because if they are so bad that you cannot use them – just like this body, if it"]],[2678,["is so bad, it’s better to give up and die – so that let that relationship die out."]],[2683,["But that death should come to you as a very forceful help, otherwise,"]],[2688,["after that, if you become a nervous personality, what’s the use?"]],[2692,["So what you have to do after such a thing has"]],[2695,["happened – that you have given up such a relationship"]],[2698,["– then, if you have to go to courts and all that,"]],[2700,["you should give up Sahaja Yoga for the time being."]],[2702,["Solve your problems."]],[2703,["Solve your court problems, everything, then come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[2706,["We do not want to get involved into this kind of a thing at all,"]],[2710,["that we have broken any family or anything."]],[2712,["If you cannot carry on with a wife,"]],[2714,["not that Sahaja Yoga should not be an excuse because you can not carry on with her!"]],[2719,["You should have this thing, go out of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2723,["do what you like with your wife, finish it off once"]],[2725,["for all, and you should tell her,"]],[2727,["“I’m no more a sahaja yogi.” Get it out, and then come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[2731,["But by coming to Sahaja Yoga you’ll be really troubling Me too much."]],[2735,["So I have to make a humble request to you,"]],[2738,["that if you have any a such problem don’t come."]],[2742,["Do not allow any child who is younger than a proper age,"]],[2750,["sixteen years, to be kept in"]],[2753,["the ashram without taking a full permission, written permission, from the parents."]],[2760,["Or a wife who has made problems with the husband, should not be allowed to"]],[2765,["come and stay in the ashram with the children unless and until it is resolved."]],[2770,["We are not responsible for all kinds of problems."]],[2774,["Then people who are sick or mentally deranged should not be kept in the ashram."]],[2780,["That is also quite a sympathetic attitude of so many sahaja yogis."]],[2784,["Ashram is for the best people, not for the lunatics."]],[2789,["So please do not get such people who are no good."]],[2792,["We do not want such people to come in the ashram who are going to"]],[2797,["ruin the reputation of ashram, so also that you have to establish…"]],[2803,["So coming to the relationship of Vishnumaya,"]],[2807,["is that Vishnumaya is the One Who is the sister, sister of Shri Krishna."]],[2814,["She’s the One Who announced the coming of Shri Krishna."]],[2821,["She’s the One Who sacrificed Her life to save Shri Krishna’s life."]],[2826,["Vishnumaya is the One which surrounds Shri Krishna,"]],[2829,["and She was born as Draupadi who, you"]],[2832,["know, was later on humiliated by Duryodhana,"]],[2836,["and it was Shri Krishna Who came and helped Her."]],[2839,["So it’s a very sweet relationship of purity, of help,"]],[2843,["a very delicate relationship is to be maintained of a brother and a sister."]],[2850,["And that is a special relationship today."]],[2853,["Those who want to tie the Rakhis to a sister should tie today before Me,"]],[2859,["it will be a good idea."]],[2860,["It is a greater relationship than any other relationship."]],[2864,["Because here somebody’s your own sister, is all right, but if she’s not"]],[2869,["your own sister you should know that you all are born of one Mother."]],[2873,["So the brother and sister relationship should be all right."]],[2876,["In that also one should not have preferences – because some would"]],[2884,["like to have a rich sister, or some sort of a nonsense like that."]],[2890,["Or somebody would like to have the most miserable one, this is all the mind."]],[2895,["But a relationship with a person with whom you would like to be happy,"]],[2901,["And if there is anybody left out, you should not try to do that."]],[2905,["So anybody who is listening,"]],[2908,["I would say that – best thing would be to have your lucky dips I think,"]],[2915,["for people, something like that could be done so"]],[2918,["that they choose their sisters and tie the things."]],[2923,["Which ever way you like you choose it."]],[2925,["But I have got some nice rakhis for you, that should be done today."]],[2928,["And I will be very happy."]],[2930,["And then we’ll do this little havana for the Vishnumaya."]],[2937,["May God bless you."]]]);
